{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0414_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1188ebc334b7c5152578b43c28d339ff399300d6347231376deaece849032816", "ja": "（まつりから新しい衣装を試着したから見てほしいと\n連絡があった。どんな感じかな？）", "zh": "（茉莉联系我说她试穿了新服装，想让我去看看。感觉会怎么样呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0414_1001_p", "source_sha256": "cf4e76fd4f4a1f784d5560e31a4bd374431bd823edbaf7627954de04824a12a1", "ja": "お疲れ様、まつり。\n衣装はどう……！？", "zh": "辛苦了，茉莉。\n服装怎么样……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0414_1002_021mat", "source_sha256": "7500a7630fa843c0c02bfd32070dea964f84792fa3721787129b2486657a9464", "ja": "{$P$}さん、はいほー！\nきゅーとでくーる！なまつり姫なのです♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，嗨吼——！\n是又可爱又酷的茉莉公主哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0414_1003_021mat", "source_sha256": "f4340458277639b6de49efa1ca4fc0029d600b3a863f41135a29289b9ca74402", "ja": "いつもとひと味違う、ぱーふぇくと！な姿！\n{$P$}さん、感想はどうですか？", "zh": "和平时有些不一样，超完美！的模样！\n{$P$}先生，你觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0414_1004_p", "source_sha256": "6af2dc1da2a3d4bbde86b1ad05039b495b32e4a99fd547d0194be0b8d1b8351a", "ja": "ああ。すごくいいと思う。\n落ち着いた雰囲気がして、見違えたよ。", "zh": "啊，我觉得非常棒。\n给人一种沉稳的氛围，简直判若两人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0414_1005_021mat", "source_sha256": "ba87123a82b19e5af6555ba014ce8adcebf3f2de63e3f3c55c0f5a58e4accda0", "ja": "さすが姫のナイト様……答えもぱーふぇくとなのです♪\nではここで、質問なのです！", "zh": "不愧是公主的骑士大人……回答也完美无缺呢♪  \n那么，接下来要提问啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0414_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "2f9bdaad8c764e95e7c2c1e5d5471f93273cf3d81d8658748c0f16b4d6f44ece", "ja": "男雛様と女雛様……\nこの衣装を着て演じるなら、どちらがいいのです？", "zh": "公雏大人和女雏大人……\n要穿着这身服装来演的话，您觉得哪个更好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0414_1007_p", "source_sha256": "640fb6240a6344a9e8f53e2a70691fdd9b8efcd37e939c3551a70a01a66c57e6", "ja": "む、難しい質問だな……。どっちも素敵だけど、\n多分そういうことじゃないんだよな？", "zh": "唔，这问题真难回答……两个都很棒，不过，应该不是在问这个吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0414_1008_021mat", "source_sha256": "96d166ebf151a1fb5088d66bf91ba242c04a34acde390ff62288867d19d0f1d7", "ja": "はいなのです！　{$P$}さんには\nビシッと選んでほしいのです♪", "zh": "没错！希望{$P$}先生能果断地做出选择哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0414_1009_p", "source_sha256": "fa8735350019efc3931bd67042f99d0629d052c3b64f8bcdd90df28481f3d165", "ja": "ビシッとか……うーん。\n何か判断材料があると助かるんだけど……。", "zh": "要我果断地选吗……嗯——\n要是能有点判断依据就好了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0414_1010_021mat", "source_sha256": "6430ad05e041b4a09ae098f57bc125862816ceaf8b49dd013ab29b2a1408f0c8", "ja": "もちろんなのですよ。今から姫がプレゼンするので\n見ててくださいね♪　もし、まつりが男雛様なら……。", "zh": "那当然啦。我现在就来给您做个演示，\n请好好看清楚哦♪　如果茉莉是男雏大人的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0414_1011_021mat", "source_sha256": "c45929bf8801fe431ead12aecf8759abf8dc993a87bacaaad5b3016bff927b1c", "ja": "とびきりくーるにエスコートをして、\nファンのみんなを、キュンっとさせるのです！", "zh": "要用最最酷的方式护送，让粉丝们怦然心动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0414_1012_021mat", "source_sha256": "070c83b79a3e5b3ebded1318b8ce4fd269d2d02cc2d7673c273baa1b246826ef", "ja": "もしも女雛様だったら……キラキラで\nきゅーとな姫の姿で、みんなをメロメロにするのです♪", "zh": "如果我是女雏大人的话……就要以闪闪发光、\n可爱动人的公主模样，让大家都为我神魂颠倒♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0414_1013_p", "source_sha256": "46490f2022f736142786e5360a5ca788e337aba868cd5d4d570f5b10de15cef3", "ja": "キュン……メロメロ……。\n……よし、決めた！", "zh": "心动……神魂颠倒……。\n……好，决定了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0414_1014_021mat", "source_sha256": "f4094f60b01d4c0d4a99880c9d50b277666cb63b7abe39bb0d7913ea14f4084b", "ja": "はいほー！　それでは、{$P$}さん。\n答えをどうぞ、なのです♪", "zh": "嗨哟！那么，{$P$}先生。请说出答案吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0414_1015", "source_sha256": "527e06bc376f00ab549e247cb285933278169c10d9735c21014ada529e35434e", "ja": "両方！", "zh": "两个都要！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0414_2000_p", "source_sha256": "d82771f4d21707072851532259b6f9849c813d968fe7b89f0304d4f8736e1688", "ja": "やっぱり、どっちのまつりも見てみたい。\nだから両方だ！", "zh": "我果然还是想看到这两个不同模样的茉莉。\n所以选两边都要！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0414_2001_021mat", "source_sha256": "df55cca09facc03f084bb1de07d68a32ea28a319ba095339ffd3d17092cac5c0", "ja": "……ほ？　両方？　……{$P$}さんは\nとーっても欲張りさんなのですね。", "zh": "……嗯？两边？……{$P$}先生还真是个超级贪心的人呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0414_2002_021mat", "source_sha256": "9469dfed82d8cab55828d26b8b0ff1ef9bc2f6fa07fdf3804e5bf2561e8a56ae", "ja": "ふふっ。ご要望に応えて、きゅーとでかわいく、そして\nちょっとくーるに……欲張りまつり姫でいくのです！", "zh": "呵呵。那就满足您的要求，走可爱甜美又带点酷酷的路线……就由贪心的祭公主来呈现啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0414_2003_p", "source_sha256": "762dbec3612a68640f02eb703a7a5edd6be51189251fc32bc3c67de0f99366ea", "ja": "い、いいのか？", "zh": "这、这样真的好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0414_2004_021mat", "source_sha256": "6d5a72f831671331ca33dda8645c9e02fdef7ae36602f8b8bf0561267acf7723", "ja": "いいのです♪　あっ！\nでもひとつだけ、譲れないものがあるのです。", "zh": "当然可以♪啊！\n不过，有一样东西是绝对不能让步的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0414_2005_p", "source_sha256": "a9596949a33cf19a98d739afb7f41e847abf0a234466769e3d69d03673a50c42", "ja": "譲れないものって？", "zh": "不能让步的东西？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0414_2006_021mat", "source_sha256": "f93189991da83fad317d8a89a07c15a7d75fec345da109f692c978591a318d49", "ja": "姫のエスコートは{$P$}さんしか\nできないのです。たとえ、まつりが男雛様でも……。", "zh": "护送公主这件事，只能由{$P$}先生来做呢。就算茉莉扮的是男雏大人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0414_2007_021mat", "source_sha256": "eb207f066131c04df38cd5db7904f7f45363bf76483f809c14eeefe058b3526a", "ja": "その隣には、ナイト様がいてくれないと。とびきり\n素敵なエスコート、期待してるのです。……ね？　ね？", "zh": "在公主身边，可不能没有骑士大人陪着。期待您为我带来最棒的护送哦。……好吗？好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
